  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\n**Decoding signs:**\n\n \n \n\n **Letter**\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n **Stands For**\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\n**Required resultant:** 1049\n\nSo, checking each option one by one\n\nOption 1) 94 C 11 D 180 A 4 B 60 ⇒ 94 + 11 - 180 ÷ 4 × 60\n\n⇒ 94 + 11 - __**180 **____**÷**____** 4**__ × 60\n\n⇒ 94 + 11 - __**45**____** × 60**__\n\n⇒ __**94 + 11**__ - 2700\n\n⇒ __**105 - 2700**__\n\n⇒ -2595\n\nOption 2) 94 B 11 D 180 A 4 C 60 ⇒ 94 × 11 - 180 ÷ 4 + 60\n\n⇒ 94 × 11 - __**180 **____**÷**____** 4**__ + 60\n\n⇒ __**94 ×**____** 11**__ - 45 + 60\n\n⇒ __**1034 + 60**__ - 45\n\n⇒ __**1094 - 45**__\n\n⇒ __**1049**__\n\nOption 3) 94 D 11 B 180 A 4 C 60 ⇒ 94 - 11 × 180 ÷ 4 + 60\n\n⇒ 94 - 11 × __**180 **____**÷**____** 4**__ + 60\n\n⇒ 94 - __**11 **____**× 45**__ + 60\n\n⇒ __**94 **____**+ 60**__ - 495\n\n⇒ __**154 - 495**__\n\n⇒ -341\n\nOption 4) 94 A 11 D 180 B 4 C 60 ⇒ 94 ÷ 11 - 180 × 4 + 60\n\n⇒ __**94 ÷**____** 11**__ - 180 × 4 + 60\n\n⇒ 8.54 - __**180 **____**×**____** 4**__ + 60\n\n⇒ 8.54 + 60 - 720\n\n⇒ __**78.54 - 720**__\n\n⇒ -641.46\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
